OL,3,APalestinian teens killed during settler
OL,4,Aattack on West Bank village, officials
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Israeli military stated that its
OL,8,Fforces had entered the village to
OL,9,Fprovide security for an Israeli
OL,10,Fcivilian and police trying to retrieve
OL,11,Flivestock.
OL,13,FIt said the forces fired on and struck
OL,14,Fwhat it called "key instigators" of a
OL,15,F"violent disturbance", in which
OL,16,FPalestinians threw stones at its
OL,17,Ftroops.
